[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10923.429, "timestamp": "03:02:03", "text": "我不搬家。你这就去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10930.23, "timestamp": "03:02:10", "text": "喷射。在飞机坠落前弹射逃生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10933.67, "timestamp": "03:02:13", "text": "那艘船。好的。是的。是的。喷射。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10944.63, "timestamp": "03:02:24", "text": "呃，真是令人震惊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10947.309, "timestamp": "03:02:27", "text": "现在，当你着陆后，试着这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10950.07, "timestamp": "03:02:30", "text": "时间。你想再试一次吗？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10960.23, "timestamp": "03:02:40", "text": "你又回来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10969.11, "timestamp": "03:02:49", "text": "我们只是在教乔如何如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10979.429, "timestamp": "03:02:59", "text": "是的。他目前正在练习"}]